        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\epsilon_{b} - 2 \epsilon_{a} - 2 \epsilon_{c}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>공식이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$2 \epsilon_{b} - \epsilon_{a} + \epsilon_{c}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>εc의 부호가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$2 \epsilon_{b} - \epsilon_{a} - \epsilon_{c}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>2εb − εa − εc이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
